VALUES ('recXcvKvWb2CrQyb6', 'girona-riders-girona', 'Escola ciclisme Girona - Girona Riders', 'Pavelló Fontajau', '672 53 83 71', 'info@gironariders.com', 'https://www.gironariders.com/', 'Girona - Domeny i Fontajau', 'Des de Girona Riders oferim un extraescolar de ciclisme de muntanya, on es', 'https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/55/55/1783540800000/twOsGDdg8M9JhfspKyzAJw/Dex65y51N5GneYsnPwcb9NuhpFs5Q5D8FC4iE54_PQIz89U21gg32Dmqu4orvqksSXw1LwZ6rLg9wCgWhoruWKSqaTm7Jc3RvRRj67Nqw6rIBgxGL1nn1kNe9IdSW9RhqG1bdZ5JJ7qt7hejNKY95-5mSrTWcI3Ay4a9Or_JvSG07fxAjdE9wGHLkDQuAhEgbVqzPNZ6djGSyHh2akac0g/TBH02UvAmK8Z_d-eZnGURwdGDqfijtmejqkL3m2E_QE', TRUE, '', 'girona')
